WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
Set base.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.440
Move forward.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.660
Stop.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.800
Turn right.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.960
Turn left.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.320
Go backwards.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.440
Move forward.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.410
Stop.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:30.060
Return to base.
